<h2>What We Are Not: Contractors vs Public Adjusters</h2>
<p>Austin Roofing is a roofing contractor. We are not public adjusters, and Texas law does not allow a contractor to act as one on a project it is performing. That means we do not negotiate your settlement, sign anything on your behalf, or tell you what your policy covers. Coverage decisions are between you and your insurance company.</p>
